#: src/Admin/AdminMenu.php:363
msgid "An order whose status is neither one of FluentCart’s own nor defined here — a status that was removed while orders were still on it, or a value written by something else — is listed below. FluentCart shows such an order by its raw slug. Move the orders to a status that exists."
